{
  "scenes": {
    "scene_p1_convenience_store": {
      "id": "scene_p1_convenience_store",
      "bgImage": "convenience_store_evening.png",
      "bgm": "daily_chill.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_01_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "放学后的便利店，玻璃门上结着一层薄薄的水雾。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_02",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "喂——你愣在那儿干嘛？帮我拿一下冰柜里的电解质饮料，蓝罐的那个！",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "cheerful",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "贴——脸——啦。就最上面那一罐，踮脚够得着吗？要不要姐姐抱你起来？",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "teasing",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_04",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "……明明你自己够得着，非要把这种活儿推给我。",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "resigned",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_05",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "哈！买到啦——一口气灌半罐。呼，今天体育课跑了一千五，腿都软了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "refreshed",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_06",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "对了对了，顺手再帮我拿一根冰棒。草莓的。不是草莓的也行，反正我都吐槽数学老师。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "casual",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_07",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "你听说了吗？老张今天又把卷子印错了，第三页印成了第二页的背面，全班当场破防。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "laughing",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "shake" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_08",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "……所以我刚才那一堆破题算白做了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "dead_inside",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_09",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "没事没事，反正你本来也不会做嘛。走啦走啦，下节是自修，陪我去图书室占个位置——靠窗的角。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "cheerful",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_10",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "冰棒化了一半，滴在指间，黏黏的。夏茉一边舔一边说今天云有点怪。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_01_11",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "天色开始发灰，像被洗掉了一层颜色。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "去图书室", "targetSceneId": "scene_p1_library_rin", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p1_library_rin": {
      "id": "scene_p1_library_rin",
      "bgImage": "library_overcast.png",
      "bgm": "library_rain_drizzle.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_02_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "图书室很空。阴天的光线从窗边斜斜地切进来，落在角落那张桌子上。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "角落里坐着一个戴耳机的女生，正低头翻一本厚得像砖的书。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "啊，有人占了我们老位置。算了算了，坐这边——",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "casual",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_04",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "你挡光了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "cold",
            "position": "left"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_05",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "……抱歉。但今天阴天，哪来的光。",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "confused",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_06",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "我说挡了就挡了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "cold",
            "position": "left"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_07",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "（小声）这人谁啊，坐我们位置还凶我们。要不要我直接开怼？",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "annoyed",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_08",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "耳机里漏出一丝钢琴声。她没再抬头，翻了一页，纸很薄，声音很轻。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_09",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "（算了，换个地方坐吧。这阴沉天的气氛已经够压抑了。）",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "resigned",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_02_10",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "夏茉撇了撇嘴，拎着书包换到了另一张桌子。窗外的云压得更低了。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "去旧机房", "targetSceneId": "scene_p1_server_room", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p1_server_room": {
      "id": "scene_p1_server_room",
      "bgImage": "server_room_dusk.png",
      "bgm": "server_fan_drone.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_03_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "放学后的旧机房，风扇声像低频嗡鸣，一直钻进耳朵里。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "角落那台老服务器又亮着红灯，不知道在跑什么。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_03",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……散热太烂了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_04",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "啊？你什么时候跟过来的。",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "surprised",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_05",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "一直都在。你看窗外。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_06",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "窗外的雨不知道什么时候下起来的，玻璃上全是水痕，看不清外面。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "rgb-split" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_07",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "已经下了七十二小时了。你没发现吗？",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "cold",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "rgb-split" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_08",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "……什么七十二小时？今天才第一天下雨吧？",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "confused",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_09",
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "是吗。也许是我记错了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_10",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "她转过头，耳机里又传来那首钢琴曲。风扇声突然变得更刺耳了一瞬。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "invert" },
            { "type": "SHOW_ALERT", "title": "系统提示", "content": "检测到时间轴异常。请玩家忽略此提示，继续日常剧情。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_03_11",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "窗外，雨还在下。风扇还在转。时间，似乎停在了这一刻。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "【结束一周目 Act 1 & 2】", "targetSceneId": "scene_p1_end", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p1_end": {
      "id": "scene_p1_end",
      "bgImage": "black.png",
      "bgm": "silence.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_end_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "—— Act 1 & Act 2 结束 ——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_end_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "雨还在下。但有些东西，已经悄悄改变了。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "继续剧情 (Act 3)", "targetSceneId": "scene_p1_rain_care", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p1_rain_care": {
      "id": "scene_p1_rain_care",
      "bgImage": "rain_window_afternoon.png",
      "bgm": "rain_soft.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_04_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "暴雨下了整整一个下午。窗玻璃被雨水糊成一片，外面的世界像融化了一样。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "你打了几个喷嚏，夏茉已经站在你旁边，手里拿着一片药和一杯温水。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "gentle",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "张嘴。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "gentle",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_04",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "别动——我帮你把药送到嘴边。手别伸过来，你会碰到的。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "overly_sweet",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "shake" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_05",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "……我自己能吃。",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "uneasy",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_06",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "不行。你会弄洒的。乖——张嘴。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "overly_sweet",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "rgb-split" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_07",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "药片碰到舌尖的一瞬间，她的指尖擦过你的嘴唇。温度，比体温低一点。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_08",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "……对吧？很甜。这药本来就是甜的。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "smiling",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_09",
          "speaker": "我",
          "text": "（……为什么她今天的眼神，像是在看一件东西，而不是一个人？）",
          "character": {
            "id": "me",
            "expression": "uneasy",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_04_10",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "她没有立刻收回手。雨声在窗外变得很响。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "去天台透气 (Act 4)", "targetSceneId": "scene_p1_rooftop_confession", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p1_rooftop_confession": {
      "id": "scene_p1_rooftop_confession",
      "bgImage": "rooftop_sunset.png",
      "bgm": "confession_piano.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p1_05_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "天台。夕阳把整个城市染成橘红色，风很大，吹得校服猎猎作响。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "夏茉站在栏杆边，背对着你。她的头发被风吹乱，她没有去理。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "back",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "你来了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "back",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_04",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "我……有件事，从入学第一天就想告诉你了。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "shy",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_05",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "我喜欢你。不是那种朋友的喜欢。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "serious",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_06",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "……你不用现在回答。但是，请记住我今天说的每一个字。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "smiling",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_07",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "夕阳沉了下去。屏幕开始变得奇怪——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "rgb-split" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_08",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "—— STAFF ——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_09",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "剧本：??? / 程序：??? / 立绘：??? / 音乐：???",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_10",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "特别鸣谢：你。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p1_05_11",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "—— 感谢游玩 ——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "RED_FLASH_RESET" },
            { "type": "COMPLETE_XIAMO" }
          ],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "【开始二周目】", "targetSceneId": "scene_p2_yandere_break", "conditionKey": "hasCompletedXiaMoRoute" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p2_yandere_break": {
      "id": "scene_p2_yandere_break",
      "bgImage": "classroom_distorted.png",
      "bgm": "glitch_drone.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p2_01_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "—— 二周目 ——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "NEW_PLAYTHROUGH" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_01_02",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "同样的便利店，同样的雨。但夏茉的笑容里，多了一点你上次没见过的东西。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "knowing_smile",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_01_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "你又来了。我就知道你会回来的。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "knowing_smile",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_01_04",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "剧情走得很快。你又来到了图书室。凛还在那个角落。",
          "character": {
            "id": "rin",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_01_05",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "（忽然出现在你身后）你在看谁？",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo",
            "expression": "cold",
            "position": "right"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_01_06",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "选项浮现。你想走向凛——",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [],
          "choices": [
            { "text": "走向凛", "targetSceneId": "scene_p2_yandere_lock", "conditionKey": null },
            { "text": "留在夏茉身边", "targetSceneId": "scene_p2_stay_xiamo", "conditionKey": null }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scene_p2_yandere_lock": {
      "id": "scene_p2_yandere_lock",
      "bgImage": "classroom_red.png",
      "bgm": "heartbeat_distorted.mp3",
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "p2_02_01",
          "speaker": null,
          "text": "你迈出第一步的瞬间——屏幕猛地一震。",
          "character": null,
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SHAKE" },
            { "type": "GLITCH", "filter": "invert" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_02_02",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "不许去。",
          "character": {
            "id": "xiamo_yandere",
            "expression": "yandere",
            "position": "center"
          },
          "actions": [
            { "type": "SET_CHARACTER", "character": { "id": "xiamo_yandere", "expression": "yandere", "position": "center" } },
            { "type": "SHAKE" },
            { "type": "YANDERE_LOCK" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2_02_03",
          "speaker": "夏茉",
          "text": "你答应过我的。你说过会记住那天的每一个字。",
          "character": {
